# Resolved environments are not tracked: the package is tested across Julia
# versions (CI matrix: 1.10 LTS / stable / nightly) and a Manifest pinned to one
# version cannot instantiate on the others — each environment resolves fresh from
# the Project.toml compat bounds. (A Manifest resolved under 1.12 was breaking
# julia-buildpkg on the 1.10/nightly runners.)
